menu "Amity release verification"
config AMITY_PRODUCTION_UPDATES
    bool "Require provisioned production firmware verification"
    default n
    help
        Requires the approved native secure-boot, release-mode flash encryption,
        NVS encryption and provisioned publisher verification root.
        This build option never programs eFuses or changes a running profile.
config AMITY_RELEASE_PUBLIC_KEY_DER_HEX
    string "Trusted release P-256 SPKI DER (lowercase hexadecimal)"
    default ""
    help
        The SHA-256 of these public bytes is the manifest signing_key_id.
        Empty means no signed publisher is provisioned. Production fails closed.
endmenu
